# Rianell testing gates

## Minimum gate — every change

```bash
npm run test:unit          # full unit suite must pass (0 failures)
node scripts/verify/doc-links.mjs --strict   # exit 0 required
```

## Phase-specific gates

| Condition | Command |
|-----------|---------|
| After Phase 7 (foundation) | `npm run verify:migration:foundation` |
| Phase 20+ | `npm run verify:migration` |
| Phase 23+ (root hygiene) | `npm run verify:root-hygiene` |
| Phase 22 epic close | `npm run migrate:deploy-observe` |
| Phase 23 local sign-off | `npm run migrate:root-hygiene-observe` |

## Feature-area gates

| Touched area | Gate command |
|--------------|-------------|
| i18n strings | `npm run verify:i18n` (includes `--max-pct=13` coverage) |
| CSP / headers | `npm run verify:csp` |
| PWA boot / shell | `npm run audit:boot` |
| Security | `npm run verify:cspro` |
| Accessibility | `npm run verify:a11y` |
| Core Web Vitals | `npm run verify:cwv` (via `run-cwv-audit.mjs`) |

## Gate protocol (from MASTER.md)

1. Local gate passes → update CHANGELOG → commit → watch CI until green
2. Record CI run URL in MASTER.md §Section rollup CI column
3. Only then set Plan status to `done`

## Do not skip

- Never set a plan to `done` without a green CI run (or explicit `—` for post-14 plans)
- Verification checkpoints (phases 18, 19) must not be skipped even when phases run sequentially
